  'dev.hero.t': 'Musico JS Extension Developer Guide (API v1)',
  'dev.hero.d': 'Write one CommonJS script and run it natively on Apple (JavaScriptCore), Android (QuickJS), and Windows (Jint) with zero WebViews (ﾉ◕ヮ◕)ﾉ*:･ﾟ✧',
  'dev.overview.t': 'One Extension Model, Three Native Workflows',
  'dev.overview.p': 'Every Musico extension exports a manifest plus async/sync CommonJS hooks on module.exports. Depending on the capabilities you declare, your plugin plugs directly into one or more native workflows:',
  'dev.overview.li1': '<strong>Custom Cloud Sources (<code>"playlist"</code>, <code>"tree"</code>, <code>"stream"</code>):</strong> Joins the same <code>CloudSourceProvider</code> pipeline as YouTube, Bilibili, and Google Drive, automatically getting <strong>Save to Local Folder</strong>, <strong>Update from Cloud</strong>, Playlists, and custom <code>badgeLabel</code> pills.',
  'dev.overview.li2': '<strong>Extension-Only Cloud Search (<code>"search"</code>):</strong> Unlocks the opt-in Search Source Switcher in <strong>Songs</strong> (hidden when no search extensions are enabled), ephemeral playback excluded from Library &amp; Stats, and playlist/album preview sheets.',
  'dev.overview.li3': '<strong>Custom Cloud Lyrics (<code>"lyrics"</code>):</strong> Appears inside <strong>Lyrics → Search Online…</strong> alongside LRCLIB and NetEase, never running automatically during playback.',

